WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.259
We all know that the straw hats journey
through the Grand Line is heavily

00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:09.450
dominated by violence. This violence is
enacted by the various antagonists and

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:14.309
by the crews battles against them. Being
a shounen manga, fighting is a central

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:18.359
element in the story of one piece and
yet out of all the established straw

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:22.859
hats, there is only one that actually
embraces this need for battle and makes

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:26.789
it a part of his ambitions and
philosophy. Zoro is a fascinating

00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:31.710
character in many ways but it is
undeniable that at his core he is a

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:36.300
warrior. As a true swordsman inside the
straw hat crew he therefore rightfully holds

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.350
the position of 'the fighter'. And yet I
think that this position alone does not

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:45.000
satisfy the potential of this man's
unique and complex character. Much rather

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.140
it seems that Zoro has been introduced
as the counterpart of his captain that is

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:53.370
necessary in order to successfully reach
the top of the pirate world. I would

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:57.090
argue that right from the start
Zoro has been Luffy's right-hand man

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:01.620
making him much more than just a simple
fighter on the crew: Zoro is the straw

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:05.519
hat´s first mate. Now before we look at
the actions and the characteristics of

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:09.689
Zoro that qualify him for this position,
let's first establish what the roles of

00:01:09.689 --> 00:01:13.770
'fighter' and 'first mate' really mean and
what sets them apart. There is a

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:18.450
difference between being a fighter and
just being an aggressor. It is easy to

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:21.810
push around those who are weaker and
enjoy imposing your power over someone.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:25.830
As you might realize, there are many
aggressors in one piece and it is easy to

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:29.820
see why we detest them so much. A fighter
is different.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.860
Fighting is when it's hard. Fighting
means going out of your comfort zone. It

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:39.390
means not giving up. It means hating to
lose but learning from the experience.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:42.500
Anyway, fighting doesn't always involve
violence.

00:01:42.509 --> 00:01:46.920
It simply means giving you all for
something by overcoming any obstacle in

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.680
the way.
Zoro without a doubt is a true fighter.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:53.759
He identifies himself by becoming
stronger, fighting for his dream to

00:01:53.759 --> 00:01:58.320
become the greatest swordsman in the
world. In any situation he gives it his

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.930
all and sometimes even more. Zoro hates
nothing more than losing but even in

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:07.829
defeat he learns from his failure and
draws motivation and strength from them.

00:02:07.829 --> 00:02:12.450
But what sets him apart from for example
Luffy who's also a fighter in the very

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:15.390
same sense?
Another meaning of fighting is that of

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:19.620
battle. While Luffy wants to get stronger
and faces off against ever stronger

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:24.480
opponents, his true ambition is to
achieve absolute freedom. Becoming strong

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:28.739
is therefore just a necessary
requirement that has to be fulfilled.

00:02:28.739 --> 00:02:33.629
At heart Luffy only fights to resolve
conflict and to help others. Zoro is

00:02:33.629 --> 00:02:38.010
different. His ambition to become the
greatest swordsman in the world is built

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.750
on a true passion for combat. His mindset
and worldview are centered around battle

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:47.220
and strength. We do not know how Zoro
came to think that way but we only know

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:50.940
that he already strived for strength at
a very young age. While we know that

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:55.349
Zoro's character is much more complex
than this, it certainly can be said that

00:02:55.349 --> 00:02:59.430
at his core he's a person that has built
his life around fighting. In other words

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:03.989
Zoro is a true fighter through and
through. What then is the position of the

00:03:03.989 --> 00:03:09.180
first mate and why Zoro more than just
a great fighter? Usually a first mate is

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:13.799
the top officer onboard a ship after the
captain. Famous examples of this are Silvers

00:03:13.799 --> 00:03:17.760
Rayleigh, the first mate of the Roger
pirates as well as Ben Beckman the first

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:22.889
made of the red hair pirates. First mates
can fill a number of roles, from checking

00:03:22.889 --> 00:03:26.459
stock to making sure everyone else is
doing their job on the ship, leaving

00:03:26.459 --> 00:03:30.000
their captain to more important duties.
Since they are the second in command

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.560
they answer only to the captain of the
ship. Essentially the first mate is the

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.400
crew member that the captain must put
full trust in and pick very carefully.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.239
They are the captain's right-hand man
and if the captain's not at hand the

00:03:42.239 --> 00:03:46.440
first mate is the next in line to take
over the captain's job. Now as you might

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:50.940
be well aware of, the straw hats are no
regular pirate crew. The members don't

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:55.260
operate as much on hierarchy and power
as they do on trust, loyalty and

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:58.949
friendship towards another.
Additionally the crew is ridiculously

00:03:58.949 --> 00:04:03.389
small. Especially compared to any other
major player in the new world. Based on

00:04:03.389 --> 00:04:07.620
this, one could make the argument that
the position of a first mate or any type

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:11.609
of officer structure is not really
necessary inside the straw hats. This is

00:04:11.609 --> 00:04:15.900
also supported by the fact that no kind
of officer role has ever been officially

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:20.519
introduced for any of the straw hats in the
first place. And yet I think that Oda has

00:04:20.519 --> 00:04:25.320
made it very clear that Zoro is supposed
to be Luffy's right hand. Since the straw

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.400
heads are unconventional in many ways, the same goes for the

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.979
position of the first mate. On our
hero´s ship

00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:35.449
it fulfills another purpose than on
other pirate crews. Similar to Shanks or

00:04:35.449 --> 00:04:39.830
Roger, Luffy needs someone who has a more realistic and rational view on things

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:42.860
than he does.
Someone that tells him a hard truth or

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.699
reminds him of what is really important. Based on that some people argue that

00:04:46.699 --> 00:04:50.780
Nami might also be a good fit for this
role, but the first mate also needs to be

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:54.620
someone that can send next to his
captain in battle and invoke a similar

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.669
level of respect and authority.
Especially in the violent and conflict

00:04:58.669 --> 00:05:02.360
rich world of one-piece, fighting
strength is an important feature for any

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.530
captain's right hand. And as we already
have established previously, Zoro is

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:10.699
without a doubt one of the greatest
fighters in the story. So, let's look at

00:05:10.699 --> 00:05:14.900
the other qualities that Zoro has and
why they make him the only true fit for

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:18.710
the position of first mate. What makes
him more than just a great swordsman and

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.860
a fighter on the crew?
Zoro is one of the most loved

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:26.210
characters in the show for a reason. While his characteristic 3 sword style

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:30.469
and his cool design certainly play their
part in this, for many people it goes

00:05:30.469 --> 00:05:35.629
much deeper than this. On the surface he
may seem cold and distant. He's not

00:05:35.629 --> 00:05:39.650
someone to show an awful lot of emotion
and is rarely seen joking around with

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.639
his crew mates. And yet being one of the
main characters in the series we have

00:05:43.639 --> 00:05:47.089
learned a lot about Zoro over the
course of the years, that might not have

00:05:47.089 --> 00:05:51.169
been obvious at first sight. So now, let's
look at three important personality

00:05:51.169 --> 00:05:55.370
traits that qualify Zoro for the
position of the first mate. The first

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:00.440
trait that we will look at is Zoro´s
strong sense of honor and loyalty. Having

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:04.490
grown up under the strict rules of a
dojo, Zoro has without a doubt developed

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:09.169
a mindset that revolves heavily around
the honor of a swordsman. He refuses to

00:06:09.169 --> 00:06:13.099
take any action that goes against this
honor, even if it means putting his own

00:06:13.099 --> 00:06:17.150
life on the line. This was established
very early on in the story when Zoro

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:21.949
first faced off with Dracule Mihawk. His
sense of loyalty towards his captain his

00:06:21.949 --> 00:06:25.940
crewmates as well as towards his ideals
is repeatedly shown in various instances

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:30.349
as well. The most drastic example of this
is his sacrifice for Luffy on Thriller

00:06:30.349 --> 00:06:35.180
Bark, when taking on all of his captain's
damage to protect him from Kuma. In other

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:38.690
words, Zoro is the most loyal and
honorable straw hat, that

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:42.980
has stood beside Luffy from the very
beginning. Additionally, he also strives

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:47.090
to uphold these ideals when faced with
the other members actions. His appeal

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.750
towards Luffy to not take back Usopp
without an apology as well as his

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:54.410
criticism of Sanji's decision to leave
the crew behind, show how important

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.340
respect and loyalty towards his captain
are to him. This makes him the only one

00:06:58.340 --> 00:07:02.390
in the crew that actively tries to build
Luffy's authority ,so that his captain's

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:06.680
orders are respected when a critical
situation arises. The second personality

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:11.090
trait that is often overlooked within
Zoro is his kindness and empathy.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:15.650
Despite his cold and harsh appearance,
Zoro actually holds strong ideals of

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:20.090
morality and has a very kind heart. While
he would do anything for any of his

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:24.110
crewmates that he values very dearly,
he has also repeatedly proven to care

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:28.070
about strangers that are in need of help.
He carried a man shot by the celestial

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:32.210
dragon Carlos to the hospital to save
his life. And just recently, he defended

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:35.930
princess Hiyori and her companion Toko
against one of the Shogun's assassins in

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:39.860
Wano, even while fighting another
opponent. Not only are kindness and

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:44.510
empathy defining traits of straw hat
crew but Zoro also has the power to act

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:48.680
on it and defend his nakami as well as
people in need. He knows what the right

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:52.820
thing is to do and always stands close
to Luffy to bring down those who bring

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.780
injustice to the world.
Lastly being a true fighter Zoro has a

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.919
certain degree of ruthlessness and
realism, that are necessary to survive in

00:08:00.919 --> 00:08:05.060
the Grand Line and that his captain lacks.
While the straw hats are the heroes of

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:09.620
our story due to the positivity and
caring nature, sometimes they can be seen

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:14.030
as naivety. Zoro might very well be the
only member that is able to do what is

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:18.380
necessary to ensure his comrades safety
and survival. Unlike some of the members

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:22.250
of the crew Zoro does not shrink from
the idea of using deadly force against

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.760
dangerous enemies and is known to have
killed even before joining Luffy.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:29.870
Additionally, he also has a more
realistic and darker view of the world.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:33.770
While Luffy's optimism and positive
leadership style have brought the crew

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:37.190
very far on their journey, it is
nonetheless important to have a

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:41.840
perspective in the crew that sees the
things as they are. In this sense Zoro

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:45.530
perfectly completes his captain by
bringing the necessary seriousness with

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:50.120
him that has saved the straw hats  more than once. These three trades: honor and

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:53.360
loyalty, kindness and empathy, as well as ruthlessness and

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:57.350
realism make Zorro the only suitable
candidate for the man standing beside

00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:01.880
the next Pirate King. Beside these three
characteristics, there is also Zoro's

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:05.180
relationship with Luffy.
As mentioned before Zoro would do

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:09.680
anything for his captain and respects
Luffy really deeply. As the first member

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:14.450
of the crew he is what Rayleigh was to
Roger: A partner that stands side by side

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:18.860
with his leader through every situation.
When it comes to any critical situation

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:22.550
Luffy and Zoro don't need a lot of
communication to know exactly what they

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:26.360
have to do. Additionally, while Zorro
might not officially be his first mate

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:29.480
it's very clear that he's seen that way
from the outside:

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:33.640
Not only does Bartolomeo name him
as such, he was also the only member of

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:37.780
the crew that entered the group of the
supernova with Luffy. And of course he's

